title: ChromaFlow
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Edward L. Thompson
repository-code: https://github.com/edwardlthompson/chromaflow
url: https://github.com/edwardlthompson/chromaflow
abstract: >-
  Linux Mint desktop app for fan/pump curves and RGB/LED control, with hwmon
  inventory, an OpenRGB localhost SDK probe, and a polkit install-support path.
  Does not ship kernel modules.
keywords:
  - linux
  - mint
  - fans
  - rgb
  - openrgb
  - hwmon
